            "content": "[{\"namespace\":[\"memories\",\"baseline-run2-1080dc\"],\"key\":\"3b28e252-a858-453e-8225-1974fd45964e\",\"value\":{\"content\":\"Deployment: Self-hostable (Apache 2.0) as a single binary or via Docker/K8s. Managed cloud also available.\\\\n\\\\nMemory Optimization: Binary quantization reduces RAM usage up to 32x with a modest recall hit (recovered via oversampling + rescoring). In our test it cut a 24GB deployment to under 2GB of hot RAM.\\\\n\\\\nOperational Notes: New service to run: monitoring, upgrades, snapshots are all new surface. Snapshot/restore tooling is solid. Team has no prior Rust-service operational experience, though none is strictly required.\\\\n\\\\nPerformance: p95 ~12ms at 10M vectors with 97% recall. Strong filtered-search performance with payload indexes.\\\\n\\\\nTopic: qdrant\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-08-10T17:47:54.998848+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-10T17:47:54.998848+00:00\",\"score\":0.6044085746298564}]",
